                <pb facs="0191" n="81" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg81"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">714.1515/657: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Costa
                        Rica</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Davis</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-05-09T20:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 9, 1928—8
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>17. Your 27, May 8, 11 a.m. You may inform the Minister for Foreign Affairs that
                    the Department deeply appreciates his courteous action in making this
                    statement.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
